{"step_index":462,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T16:00:59Z","input_tokens":2255,"cache_read_tokens":130132,"output_tokens":5670,"thinking":"Preparing a script to modify two component files ensures precise updates to the import statements. Specifically, the script will add `UserPlus`, `Ticket`, and `QrCode` from `lucide-react` to the `IndependentTerminalApp.tsx` file's import section. This approach aims to avoid any newline discrepancies by directly manipulating the file content via the script.\n\n\nThis code manages the background images based on user preference, persisting the selected index in local storage. Initialization prioritizes local storage retrieval of the background index, defaulting to the first option if none is found or if the version has changed, to ensure backwards compatibility. The `useEffect` hook updates the current background source whenever the index changes.\n\n\nThe `toggleBackground` function updates the background index, storing the new index in local storage. Error handling is present within the `onError` handler of the image element; it attempts to load fallback images or a default image if the initial `src` fails. The image element uses `object-cover` to fit the background properly.\n\n\nThe provided code requires adjustments to its visual components, specifically for the option cards. The goal is to update the icons and badges within these cards. Replacing the placeholder icon in the second card with a specific icon, either a right arrow or a ticket icon, is necessary. The existing code snippets for the badges seem correct but need integration with the overall card structure.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst file = path.resolve('LEGENDS/src/components/access/IndependentTerminalApp.tsx');\nlet code = fs.readFileSync(file, 'utf8');\n\n// 1. Add UserPlus, Ticket, QrCode to lucide-react imports if not present\nif (!code.includes('UserPlus,')) {\n  code = code.replace(\n    /BicepsFlexed,\\s*RotateCw\\s*\\}/,\n    'BicepsFlexed,\\n  RotateCw,\\n  UserPlus,\\n  Ticket,\\n  QrCode\\n}'\n  );\n}\n\n// 2. Replace bgImage state definition with BG_OPTIONS & safe index\nconst oldStateRegex = /const\\s+\\[bgImage,\\s*setBgImage\\]\\s*=\\s*useState<string>\\(\\(\\)\\s*=>\\s*\\{[\\s\\S]*?return\\s+localStorage\\.getItem\\('legends_terminal_bg'\\)\\s*\\|\\|\\s*gymBg;\\s*\\}\\);/;\n\nconst newStateCode = `// Safe background wallpapers with verified multi-tier fallbacks\n  const BG_OPTIONS = [\n    { id: 'gymBg', name: 'Gimnasio Legends (Pared Neón & Caminadoras)', primary: gymBg, fallback: './gym-background.jpg' },\n    { id: 'gymBgMotto', name: 'Mural Motivacional Legends', primary: gymBgMotto, fallback: './gym-background-motto.jpg' },\n    { id: 'modalGymBg', name: 'Mancuernas Pro Dark', primary: modalGymBg, fallback: './modal-gym-bg.jpg' }\n  ];\n\n  const [bgIndex, setBgIndex] = useState<number>(() => {\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {\n      try {\n        const ver = localStorage.getItem('legends_terminal_bg_version');\n        if (ver !== 'v12_bulletproof_original_bg') {\n          localStorage.setItem('legends_terminal_bg_version', 'v12_bulletproof_original_bg');\n          localStorage.removeItem('legends_terminal_bg');\n          localStorage.setItem('legends_terminal_bg_index', '0');\n          return 0;\n        }\n        const saved = localStorage.getItem('legends_terminal_bg_index');\n        if (saved !== null) {\n          const parsed = parseInt(saved, 10);\n          if (!isNaN(parsed) && parsed >= 0 && parsed < BG_OPTIONS.length) return parsed;\n        }\n      } catch {}\n    }\n    return 0;\n  });\n\n  const activeBg = BG_OPTIONS[bgIndex] || BG_OPTIONS[0];\n  const [currentBgSrc, setCurrentBgSrc] = useState<string>(() => activeBg.primary || activeBg.fallback);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const chosen = BG_OPTIONS[bgIndex] || BG_OPTIONS[